{"root":"terpa","ipa":"/ˈtərpa/","core":"指猛烈地冲击、袭击或扑向某物，通常用于描述自然力量（如风、浪）或抽象概念（如灾难、情感）的突然降临。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈtərpa/","zh":"冲击，袭击","phrases":[{"t":"terpa angin","zh":"风的吹袭"},{"t":"terpa ombak","zh":"浪花的拍打"},{"t":"terpa musibah","zh":"灾难的降临"}],"examples":[{"t":"Angin kencang menerpa wajahnya.","zh":"强风猛烈地吹在他的脸上。"},{"t":"Gelombang besar menerpa pantai itu.","zh":"巨大的海浪冲击着那片海滩。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"terpa","ipa":"/ˈtərpa/","zh":"冲击（原型词）","phrase":{"t":"terpa keras","zh":"猛烈冲击"},"example":{"t":"Terpa badai itu sangat kuat.","zh":"那场风暴的冲击力非常强。"}},{"w":"menerpa","ipa":"/məˈnərpa/","zh":"冲击，扑向","phrase":{"t":"menerpa korban","zh":"扑向受害者"},"example":{"t":"Harimau itu menerpa mangsanya.","zh":"那只老虎扑向了它的猎物。"}},{"w":"menerpakan","ipa":"/mənərˈpakan/","zh":"使……冲击","phrase":{"t":"menerpakan diri","zh":"投身于，冲向"},"example":{"t":"Dia menerpakan dirinya ke dalam air.","zh":"他纵身跳入水中。"}},{"w":"terpaan","ipa":"/tərˈpaan/","zh":"冲击，袭击（名词）","phrase":{"t":"terpaan angin","zh":"风的冲击"},"example":{"t":"Rumah itu roboh akibat terpaan angin kencang.","zh":"那座房子因强风的冲击而倒塌。"}}],"derSlugs":["terpa","menerpa","menerpakan","terpaan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-10-01T02:17:49.534Z","src":"base"}